rt, they caught me...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","010",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_137","I worked so hard to finally become a Trekker... Is it all about to end like this?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","002","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Think you'd have a shot if you stopped running away and actually talked to them?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","012","sweaty",null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_137","Doubt it... I'll be lucky if they let me leave the house at all, let alone get my own place.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_137","b","005",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_137","I thought if I could prove I was a capable Trekker who could handle things myself, I could convince them...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","009","speechless",null,null,null,1.0,"chijing","OutSine",0.5],["say","avg1_137","But now... That goal feels a million miles away.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","002","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","Is that really it?",1,""],["ctl","avg1_137","b","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","003",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Nanoha actually asked me to pass a message to you.",1,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,1,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","circle_light",0,0.0],["cbg",0,null,null,4.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,1,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["show","avg1_119","a","006",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_119","a",null,"attention",null,null,null,1.0,"jushou2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_119","My master once showed me a dazzling technique. She constantly switched weapons, her attacks flexible and unpredictable.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_119","a","009","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_119","Miss Eleanor need not limit herself to a single weapon. She could try mixing different combat styles to bewilder her opponents.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_119","a","005","question",null,null,null,null,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_119","The financial means to amass such an arsenal is, after all, one of her greatest strengths. Do you not agree?",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_169"],["bgm",""],["trn",0,1,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["trn",1,1,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["show","avg1_137","b","005",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_137","b",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","020","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","Nanoha mentioned she'd seen a fighting style used by a powerful Trekker that would suit you perfectly. I had my doubts at first.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","022",null,null],["say","avg3_100","But now I'm certain: Eleanor, you have a gift for this.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","022","love",null],["say","avg3_100","So don't write yourself off yet. A Trekker is defined by their freedom—and their limitless potential.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","007","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_137","Defined by ... their freedom...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["mrt",1,"z","020",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Freedom is a state of mind, Eleanor. It isn't defined by where you are. Think about it...==W== Since you can't leave the house, why not hone your skills at home?",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"z","002","idea",null],["goon"],["mrt",0,"z","013","happy",null],["say","avg3_100","Study Artifacts, draft tactics, and learn the trade inside out. Show your family how much you've grown. Prove to them that you're ready to stand on your own in this world.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","011",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_137","Mentor...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","005","flurry",null,-0.35,1.5,null,"jushou2","Linear",0.3],["say","avg1_137","Sniff... I… Mentor, I... I really don't want to give up!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","014","music",null],["say","avg3_100","Then don't. The junior I know is a force of nature, isn't she?",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","022",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Just be yourself. Keep your eyes on the prize and run toward it—full speed ahead.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","004","exclamation",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_137","R-Right! I will!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","003",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Alright. Since you've made up your mind, I'm leaving you with a little homework.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","We'll start with weapon safety protocols...==W== Actually, scratch that. For you, the first lesson needs to be \"Commoner Economics 101\"...",1,""],["w",1.0],["mrt",0,"z","023","sweaty",null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","003","happy",null,0.0,1.0,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["say","avg1_137","Ahaha... That sounds complicated... But I'll do my best!",0,""],["ctl","avg1_137","b","013","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"jushou2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_137","For my freedom ... and so that one day, I can come see you again, Mentor!",0,""],["w",0.5],["bg","hotel_daylight",0,0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","003","star",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["film",0],["stg",0,60.0,null,null,"OutSine",3.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","0","And so, amidst laughter and lighthearted banter, our impromptu lesson comes to a close.",3,""],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["trn",0,0,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["film",1],["show","avg1_137","b","002",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","004","exclamation",null,null,null,1.0,"diantou2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_137","This isn't goodbye forever. I'm not giving up that easily!",0,""],["w",0.5],["bg","mood_1",0,0.5],["ctl","avg1_137","b","011","flower",null,-0.35,1.5,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["say","avg1_137","I'm going to become an amazing Trekker, and when I am, I'll come back for you! Just you wait, Mentor!",0,""],["w",1.0],["end"]]}